# HMR Hotspots & Safe Patterns (React Compiler)

## Hotspots (treat with care)

- Context consumers that bind many selectors/actions (e.g., File Explorer contexts)
- Provider boundaries that might remount during hot updates
- Dialogs/overlays that mount conditionally and sync local state from stores

## Safe patterns

- Keep hooks at top level; push conditional logic inside effects/callback bodies.
- Use a single store selector that returns a fixed-shape tuple for many values.
